# Anything in here is excluded from the Docker build context that gets
# uploaded to Fly's builder. Keep this aggressive — the context was 1.13 GB
# before we added this file. Most of that was local node_modules and .next.

# Dependencies — re-installed inside the image
**/node_modules

# Build outputs — re-built inside the image
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/out

# Prisma generated client — regenerated by `pnpm rebuild` in the builder stage
packages/db/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS + editor noise
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Local env files — secrets go to Fly via `fly secrets set`, never baked in
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test + coverage artifacts
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Docs, READMEs, the Claude/agent metadata — not needed at build time
.claude
.cursor
*.md
!packages/*/package.json
!apps/*/package.json
!services/*/package.json

# OS junk
Thumbs.db

# The marketing sister repo is checked out at a sibling path on the dev
# machine, not inside this one, but exclude common path names just in case.
lidh-website
